    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d251">

                <pb facs="0250" n="240" sameAs="frus:frus1941v05/pg240"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">792.94/141</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Memorandum of Conversation, by the Under Secretary of
                        State</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Welles</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">[<placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>,] <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1941-07-30">July 30, 1941</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>The British Ambassador called to see me this morning at his request. The
                    Ambassador read to me a secret telegram he had just received from his
                    Government. The British Government is informed <pb facs="0251" n="241"
                        xml:id="pg241"/> through a secret message from the Prime Minister of
                    Thailand that the Japanese are now demanding military and economic concessions
                    from the Thai Government. The Prime Minister of Thailand stated that it was
                    intimated that if these concessions were refused Japan might use force. The
                    Prime Minister of Thailand desired urgently and secretly to know what assistance
                    the British Government would give him in such an event, should the Thai
                    Government refuse to grant the concessions demanded. Lord Halifax stated that he
                    had no word as yet of the reply which would be given by his Government, but
                    assured me that he would immediately inform me of any information he might
                    receive on this point.</p>
                <p>I informed the British Ambassador of the contents of my conversation this morning
                    with the Japanese Ambassador.<anchor n="23" xml:id="d251-f1"/>
                </p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>S[<hi rendition="#small-caps">umner</hi>] W[<hi rendition="#small-caps"
                            >elles</hi>]</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
